00:10:36.930 --> 00:10:38.060
Asakusa!

00:10:39.070 --> 00:10:40.350
Are you okay?!

00:10:40.350 --> 00:10:43.420
The river swept my leg away...

00:10:43.420 --> 00:10:44.780
Like hell it did.

00:10:44.780 --> 00:10:46.330
You just weren't paying enough attention!

00:10:46.330 --> 00:10:48.080
Let's all make this a solar town

00:10:49.970 --> 00:10:51.370
The sound a kappa makes...

00:10:54.250 --> 00:10:55.750
<b>Film</b>

00:10:57.770 --> 00:10:59.100
Asakusa!

00:10:59.100 --> 00:11:01.010
Look... Look at this!

00:11:03.140 --> 00:11:04.350
<b>Reminder</b>

00:11:03.140 --> 00:11:04.350
<b>Absolutely no funds are to be
 acquired from outside of school</b>

00:11:03.140 --> 00:11:04.350
<b>Vice Principal</b>

00:11:04.350 --> 00:11:05.960
The art club's not sure

00:11:05.960 --> 00:11:07.770
if they'll be able to do the 
backgrounds because of it.

00:11:09.650 --> 00:11:12.250
The vice principal warned us.

00:11:12.850 --> 00:11:15.290
The PC club might be in the same situation.

00:11:15.290 --> 00:11:17.690
I think the vice principal's 
trying to put pressure on us.

00:11:17.690 --> 00:11:19.070
We need Kanamori!

00:11:19.070 --> 00:11:20.820
She hasn't been answering!

00:11:21.770 --> 00:11:24.320
She might be at home! Let's move!

00:11:28.350 --> 00:11:30.350
3 Years Ago

00:11:29.520 --> 00:11:33.960
<b>Kamitanukisawa School</b>

00:11:31.580 --> 00:11:33.960
<i>Expecting us to talk to random strangers...</i>

00:11:34.490 --> 00:11:36.590
<i>That'll get you reported in the real world.</i>

00:11:36.590 --> 00:11:38.700
<i>Oh, there's another loner.</i>

00:11:40.110 --> 00:11:42.030
<i>She looks like a thug.</i>

00:11:42.590 --> 00:11:45.170
<i>People like that are why I hate school.</i>

00:11:45.170 --> 00:11:48.180
All right, everybody! Pair up, back to back!

00:11:48.180 --> 00:11:52.060
Uh, Teacher, I don't have a partner yet...

00:11:52.060 --> 00:11:53.980
You two can pair up.

00:11:55.410 --> 00:11:58.690
U-Um, I can manage on my own...

00:11:58.690 --> 00:12:00.690
No, you can't.

00:12:00.690 --> 00:12:04.070
<i>Being alone is scary, but so are other people.</i>

00:12:04.070 --> 00:12:06.790
Okay, one!

00:12:06.790 --> 00:12:08.580
Two!

00:12:08.580 --> 00:12:11.040
<i>I can't do this with someone, either!</i>

00:12:11.460 --> 00:12:14.430
<i>Honestly, they're always 
trying to make us socialize.</i>

00:12:18.550 --> 00:12:21.390
<i>Well, fitting in with society can suck it.</i>

00:12:22.030 --> 00:12:25.430
<i>I know... I can be a hermit when I grow up.</i>

00:12:25.430 --> 00:12:27.380
<i>I mean, friends would be nice, but...</i>

00:12:27.380 --> 00:12:29.870
Hey, girl who wants friends.

00:12:30.820 --> 00:12:33.090
Wanna make money from some leaves?

00:12:32.580 --> 00:12:35.170
Thugbelina!

00:12:33.090 --> 00:12:34.020
Leaves?

00:12:34.020 --> 00:12:34.850
Leaves.

00:12:35.410 --> 00:12:38.230
You were playing around in the grass, right?

00:12:38.230 --> 00:12:42.820
I... uh... don't know any magic tricks,
 so I wouldn't be able to...

00:12:44.670 --> 00:12:48.410
<i>I wasn't sure how to say no, 
so I ended up going along with her.</i>

00:12:51.820 --> 00:12:53.710
<i>Is this good enough?</i>

00:12:54.130 --> 00:12:55.830
Uh, I have some here.

00:12:56.420 --> 00:12:57.460
Thanks.

00:12:58.130 --> 00:12:58.940
Here.

00:13:00.930 --> 00:13:02.760
A thousand yen?!

00:13:02.760 --> 00:13:05.680
My mother told me never to 
accept money from strangers!

00:13:05.680 --> 00:13:10.100
I need to take the train to 
sell these, so if you'll excuse me.

00:13:10.100 --> 00:13:11.010
Train?!

00:13:11.870 --> 00:13:13.640
I-I'll join you!

00:13:13.640 --> 00:13:16.650
You don't have to do that.

00:13:16.650 --> 00:13:20.250
I've never rode a train before.

00:13:21.230 --> 00:13:23.590
Uh, well...

00:13:24.780 --> 00:13:27.320
So why haven't you?

00:13:27.320 --> 00:13:29.280
I'm bad with crowds.

00:13:29.860 --> 00:13:32.270
And I wanted to be with a friend when I did.

00:13:34.190 --> 00:13:37.220
Please stop hiding behind me.

00:13:37.220 --> 00:13:39.770
Besides, I'm not exactly your friend, am I?

00:13:40.490 --> 00:13:42.300
But what about in PE?

00:13:42.300 --> 00:13:44.570
The idea that all children 
can potentially be friends

00:13:44.570 --> 00:13:47.540
is magical thinking on 
the part of the educators.

00:13:47.540 --> 00:13:50.320
Our interests simply coincided at the time,

00:13:50.320 --> 00:13:52.510
since we had no one else.

00:13:54.010 --> 00:13:56.520
So friendship is magical?

00:13:56.520 --> 00:14:00.610
That said... we'll probably be 
coexisting at school for the time being,

00:14:00.610 --> 00:14:02.740
so there's bound to be a bit of give-and-take.

00:14:02.740 --> 00:14:04.460
Coexistence?

00:14:04.990 --> 00:14:06.530
I'll be going now.

00:14:06.530 --> 00:14:07.830
Wait!

00:14:07.830 --> 00:14:09.570
I'll carry this for you.

00:14:09.570 --> 00:14:13.630
I'll be joining you, and you 
won't have to carry the bag!

00:14:13.630 --> 00:14:15.200
It's coexistence!

00:14:16.710 --> 00:14:18.350
<i>What's with her?</i>

00:14:23.540 --> 00:14:25.380
Wow!

00:14:31.010 --> 00:14:33.290
I didn't know trains were this amazing.

00:14:35.310 --> 00:14:36.600
What are you doing?

00:14:37.710 --> 00:14:39.350
Um, making blueprints.

00:14:41.350 --> 00:14:42.760
<b>Has a propeller affixed for acceleration,
 which is under evolution evaluation</b>

00:14:41.350 --> 00:14:42.760
<b>Rack Railway
 Able to reach an equilibrium speed
 of 112km/h on a 1000% incline!
 A propeller-equipped train created
 in the 1930s by the German National Railway!</b>

00:14:41.350 --> 00:14:44.130
<b>The Ethereal Monorail Soars!</b>

00:14:41.350 --> 00:14:44.130
<b>Something sounds (good) about
 a train that flies through the sky</b>

00:14:41.350 --> 00:14:44.130
<b>Black Hole
Engine</b>

00:14:41.350 --> 00:14:45.280
<b><u>Catalog Spec:</u>
 Total Length: 25.675m
 Total Width: 3.362m
 Overall height: 4.8m
 Maximum operational weight: 52.2 tons
Maximum speed 22.6 km/h
(Maximum output: 66,000 horsepower)

00:14:41.690 --> 00:14:45.610
Ta-dah! The use of "ethereal" refers to 
how it flies gracefully through the air!

00:14:44.500 --> 00:14:48.670
<b>Rail Connector Unit 
Connector Unit
Spherical Car
Conductor controls the orientation</b>

00:14:44.500 --> 00:14:48.670
<b>Car travels while staying horizontal</b>

00:14:46.550 --> 00:14:48.700
You can bring your bicycle aboard, too.

00:14:49.220 --> 00:14:51.360
And the train itself is 
a propeller-equipped model, like the

00:14:50.590 --> 00:14:54.660
<b>Mole</b>

00:14:51.360 --> 00:14:52.640
<b>Travels along something similar to a ropeway!!</b>

00:14:51.360 --> 00:14:52.700
German National Railway made!

00:14:53.310 --> 00:14:55.090
With super-strong connectors!

00:14:53.600 --> 00:14:55.270
<b>Connection is very strong</b>

00:14:53.890 --> 00:14:55.720
<b>Train car</b>

00:14:55.090 --> 00:14:58.660
Hypothetically, there may even be 
a hanging, armored monorail car!

00:14:55.100 --> 00:15:02.380
<b>Can be affixed in a variety of positions as necessary thanks to articulation</b>

00:14:59.110 --> 00:15:01.900
The connection to the rail can be 
adjusted for a variety of angles!

00:15:05.770 --> 00:15:06.820
Hello again.

00:15:08.570 --> 00:15:10.110
Thank you so much!

00:15:13.450 --> 00:15:15.250
What're they for?

00:15:15.250 --> 00:15:17.830
We serve grilled fish on them.

00:15:17.830 --> 00:15:20.600
The aroma is great, and they
 look wonderful, too.

00:15:21.650 --> 00:15:22.900
Thank you.

00:15:28.750 --> 00:15:32.090
So when did you become friends with Kanamori?

00:15:32.090 --> 00:15:34.430
Kanamori's not my friend.

00:15:35.110 --> 00:15:36.570
Then are we...

00:15:36.570 --> 00:15:39.360
We're not friends, we're comrades!

00:15:39.360 --> 00:15:40.670
Comrades, huh?

00:15:42.120 --> 00:15:44.140
Lady Kanamori, you're sick?

00:15:44.140 --> 00:15:46.000
She is?

00:15:50.750 --> 00:15:51.960
You need anything?

00:15:51.960 --> 00:15:53.260
Milk.

00:15:54.970 --> 00:15:56.110
Thank you.

00:15:56.540 --> 00:15:59.520
Oh, could you get my phone, please?

00:16:11.390 --> 00:16:14.160
Hey there, sicko! We're here to check up on you.

00:16:15.050 --> 00:16:16.740
You don't have to get up!

00:16:16.740 --> 00:16:18.100
Here's some milk.

00:16:16.740 --> 00:16:18.700
<b>Sunny Day
 Milk</b>

00:16:19.050 --> 00:16:20.700
Thanks.

00:16:20.700 --> 00:16:22.810
You seem weak as a kitten.

00:16:22.810 --> 00:16:25.080
It seems I'm only human after all.

00:16:25.670 --> 00:16:29.190
I can even take candid shots, 
and you can't throttle me!

00:16:31.470 --> 00:16:33.330
Oh, right, Kanamori...

00:16:33.330 --> 00:16:34.590
Look here.

00:16:34.590 --> 00:16:38.560
<b>Reminder</b>

00:16:34.590 --> 00:16:40.350
<b>Absolutely no funds are to be
 acquired from outside of school</b>

00:16:34.590 --> 00:16:40.350
<b>Vice Principal</b>

00:16:35.030 --> 00:16:37.500
This was posted on the door to our club room.

00:16:37.500 --> 00:16:38.610
And the art club said—

00:16:38.610 --> 00:16:40.350
It won't be a problem.

