<b>Kappa Soldier 1</b>

00:22:26.180 --> 00:22:28.150
Okay, it's done!

00:22:28.650 --> 00:22:30.190
Impressive.

00:22:30.190 --> 00:22:31.430
There are so many...

00:22:31.430 --> 00:22:32.740
'Cuz I added more!

00:22:33.390 --> 00:22:35.750
<b>Film</b>

00:22:37.710 --> 00:22:40.820
Finished with time to spare! 
Are we awesome or what?

00:22:40.820 --> 00:22:42.630
What are you talking about?

00:22:42.630 --> 00:22:46.900
The goal is producing a bunch of DVDs 
this time, so we're cutting it close again.

00:22:45.250 --> 00:22:47.720
<b>Flower petals scattering.
Animated shot tracking back from the camera.
32 people shake hands,
 each stepping back afterwards.</b>

