What the heck is this?

00:23:11.190 --> 00:23:12.600
What's this music?!

00:23:16.790 --> 00:23:18.230
Is this really the track?

00:23:18.230 --> 00:23:19.890
I think so.

00:23:19.890 --> 00:23:21.980
And this is the only track we've got?

00:23:21.980 --> 00:23:23.670
It's nothing like the demo!

00:23:25.530 --> 00:23:27.860
It doesn't match at all!

